WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:02,910
How about I take Yu Yu back first?

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:05,300
If she were really happy in China

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,920
It's not too late to send it back later.

4
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,210
Please take a trip

5
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:14,210
Take Yu Yu back to America

6
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:16,690
Just take it back temporarily

7
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:18,690
If Yu Yu still wants to come back

8
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:21,350
I will send her back again

9
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:22,350
You are her father, right

10
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:24,350
But you don’t even have a car now

11
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,350
The place to live is not big either.

12
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:27,350
Can you really give her a better life?
